  "components/button/overview": {
    "content": {
      "component": "Page",
      "props": {
        "title": "Button",
        "description": "The six control recipes, each on any ramp. Hover, press, and disabled are not written here at all — `data-control` puts the recipe's own states on the element, so a button's stylesheet is the box and nothing else.",
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "component": "Section",
          "props": {
            "title": "Variants",
            "description": "`normal` is the neutral control on the paper, edged by a hairline; `recessed` is the same control one step into the paper, the workaday grey chip a toolbar or a footer is full of, and the default. `filled` is the one action a view points at; `outlined` its drawn twin; `tinted` a quiet accent chip; `plain` looks like text at rest but keeps the box, because its recipe washes on hover.",
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "component": "Stack",
              "children": [
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "normal"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "normal"},
                      "children": ["Save changes"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "normal", "disabled": true},
                      "children": ["Disabled"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "recessed"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "recessed"},
                      "children": ["Save changes"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "recessed", "disabled": true},
                      "children": ["Disabled"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "filled"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Save changes"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "filled", "disabled": true},
                      "children": ["Disabled"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "tinted"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "tinted"},
                      "children": ["Save changes"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "tinted", "disabled": true},
                      "children": ["Disabled"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "outlined"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "outlined"},
                      "children": ["Save changes"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "outlined", "disabled": true},
                      "children": ["Disabled"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "plain"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Save changes"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "plain", "disabled": true},
                      "children": ["Disabled"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
              ],
            },
          ],
        },
        {
          "component": "Section",
          "props": {
            "title": "Tints",
            "description": "Hover any of these: the hover and press states come from the same recipe, so a danger button darkens the way a primary one does. Nothing below sets a colour — each row is one variant read against six ramps. `recessed` and `normal` are absent on purpose: they are the neutral controls, reading the theme's surface and ink roles rather than a ramp, so `tint` leaves them untouched.",
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "component": "Stack",
              "children": [
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "filled"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "primary", "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Primary"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "neutral", "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Neutral"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "info", "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Info"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "success", "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Success"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "warning", "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Warning"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "danger", "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Danger"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "tinted"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "primary", "variant": "tinted"},
                      "children": ["Primary"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "neutral", "variant": "tinted"},
                      "children": ["Neutral"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "info", "variant": "tinted"},
                      "children": ["Info"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "success", "variant": "tinted"},
                      "children": ["Success"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "warning", "variant": "tinted"},
                      "children": ["Warning"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "danger", "variant": "tinted"},
                      "children": ["Danger"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "outlined"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "primary", "variant": "outlined"},
                      "children": ["Primary"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "neutral", "variant": "outlined"},
                      "children": ["Neutral"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "info", "variant": "outlined"},
                      "children": ["Info"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "success", "variant": "outlined"},
                      "children": ["Success"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "warning", "variant": "outlined"},
                      "children": ["Warning"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "danger", "variant": "outlined"},
                      "children": ["Danger"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "plain"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "primary", "variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Primary"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "neutral", "variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Neutral"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "info", "variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Info"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "success", "variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Success"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "warning", "variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Warning"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"tint": "danger", "variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Danger"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
              ],
            },
          ],
        },
        {
          "component": "Section",
          "props": {
            "title": "Sizes",
            "description": "Button keeps no per-size block at all: the `[data-size]` profile carries the height, the padding, the radius and the type face, and the stylesheet reads them once.",
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "component": "Stack",
              "children": [
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "small"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"size": "small", "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Export"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"size": "small"},
                      "children": ["Cancel"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"size": "small", "variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Learn more"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "medium"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"size": "medium", "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Export"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"size": "medium"},
                      "children": ["Cancel"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"size": "medium", "variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Learn more"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "large"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"size": "large", "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": ["Export"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"size": "large"},
                      "children": ["Cancel"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"size": "large", "variant": "plain"},
                      "children": ["Learn more"],
                    },
                  ],
                },
              ],
            },
          ],
        },
        {
          "component": "Section",
          "props": {
            "title": "Content",
            "description": "An icon is a child rather than a prop, so it costs the component no API and takes the button's own colour through `currentColor`. A shortcut is the one trailing slot, set in the button's colour at a lowered opacity — a key cap inside a button would read as a second control. There is no `loading` prop either: work in flight is a spinner in the label and `disabled` on the button.",
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "component": "Stack",
              "children": [
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "icon"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "filled"},
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "component": "Icon",
                          "props": {
                            "name": "ArrowDownload20Regular",
                            "size": 14,
                          },
                        },
                        "Export",
                      ],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "shortcut"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"variant": "filled", "shortcut": "⌘S"},
                      "children": ["Translate"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"shortcut": "⌘⇧S"},
                      "children": ["Translate all"],
                    },
                    {
                      "component": "Inline",
                      "children": [
                        "A KeyCap is the other way to print a key:",
                        " ",
                        {
                          "component": "KeyCap",
                          "props": {"size": "small"},
                          "children": ["⌘F"],
                        },
                      ],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "busy"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {"disabled": true, "variant": "filled"},
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "component": "Spinner",
                          "props": {"size": "small", "tint": "primary"},
                        },
                        "Translating…",
                      ],
                    },
                  ],
                },
              ],
            },
          ],
        },
        {
          "component": "Section",
          "props": {
            "title": "In a row",
            "description": "Where more than one button sits together, the row is an ActionBar so the gap comes from the control scale. The confirming action goes last and is the only filled one: two filled buttons side by side ask the reader to choose which is the default.",
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "component": "Stack",
              "children": [
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "confirming"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "ActionBar",
                      "props": {"align": "end"},
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "component": "Button",
                          "children": ["Cancel"],
                        },
                        {
                          "component": "Button",
                          "props": {"variant": "filled"},
                          "children": ["Export"],
                        },
                      ],
                    },
                  ],
                },
                {
                  "component": "Specimen",
                  "props": {"label": "destructive"},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "ActionBar",
                      "props": {"align": "end"},
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "component": "Button",
                          "children": ["Keep"],
                        },
                        {
                          "component": "Button",
                          "props": {"tint": "danger", "variant": "filled"},
                          "children": ["Delete glossary"],
                        },
                      ],
                    },
                  ],
                },
              ],
            },
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
